{"version":1,"content":"<p>微軟正在為Windows 11開發一項全新的安全驗證機制，未來應用程式在啓動前能夠統一檢查電腦是否符合微軟設定的安全標準。如果設備未達到要求，軟件開發商可以自行決定是否允許程序運行、限制部分功能，甚至直接拒絕啓動應用。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586890.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T06:47:02.552543+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T06:18:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T06:40:20.985839+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T06:40:20.985839+00:00","content_hash":"76977959d699364efe793afcb0611f1663f2645ed22e6e1952178a95ba12487f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}